          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದಂಗೆ — daṅge — \"a revolt; an uprising\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಜನರು ಆ ರಾಜನ ವಿರುದ್ಧ ದಂಗೆ ಎದ್ದರು. janaru ā rājana viruddha daṅge eddaru. The people rose in revolt against that king."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One \"rises\" in revolt: ದಂಗೆ (daṅge) ಏಳು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದಂಗೆ (daṅge) is usually traced to Hindustani daṅgā, \"a riot, a disturbance\"; its earlier history is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
