          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕ್ರಾಂತಿ — krānti — \"a revolution\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ಕ್ರಾಂತಿ ದೇಶದ ಇತಿಹಾಸವನ್ನೇ ಬದಲಿಸಿತು. ā krānti dēśada itihāsavannē badalisitu. That revolution changed the country's history."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಕ್ರಾಂತಿಗಳು, krāntigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a great change: ಹಸಿರು ಕ್ರಾಂತಿ (krānti), the green revolution in farming."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕ್ರಾಂತಿ (krānti) is borrowed from Sanskrit krānti, \"going, proceeding, a step\", and \"overcoming\" (Monier-Williams); \"a revolution\" is a modern sense."
            }
          ]
        },
