          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ ಮಾಡು — biḍugaḍe māḍu — \"to set free; to release\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೊಸ ರಾಜ ಎಲ್ಲ ಗುಲಾಮರನ್ನು ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ ಮಾಡಿದನು. hosa rāja ella gulāmarannu biḍugaḍe māḍidanu. The new king set all the slaves free."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ ಮಾಡಿದೆ, biḍugaḍe māḍide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also used of a film or a book coming out: ಸಿನಿಮಾ ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ ಆಯಿತು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ ಮಾಡು (biḍugaḍe māḍu) is native Dravidian: ಬಿಡುಗಡೆ, \"release\", is built on biḍu, \"to let loose, to let go\" (DEDR 5393), with māḍu, \"to do\" (DEDR 4797)."
            }
          ]
        },
